  "description": "Since their school days, Ki Tae-Hwa and Lee Yea-Ju have been known as inseparable friends. But after Tae-Swa loses his girlfriend because of Yea-Ju, he creates distance between them, using his enlistment as an excuse. After his discharge, they meet again at a drinking party. Yea-Ju confesses that he has remained single, quietly enduring the loneliness left by Tae-Hwa’s absence. Unable to turn away, Tae-Hwa lets himself drift into a moment he never intended, telling himself it is only temporary. As he moves forward, hoping to return to the friendship they once had, he begins to question whether that is truly what he wants.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
